# Netlify redirects for hummus-amamamusi.pl
# Old Wix addresses -> new site (301 = permanent).
# www and http are handled by Netlify itself once hummus-amamamusi.pl is the primary domain.
# Forced line (301!) must come first: Netlify would otherwise serve en.html at /en without redirecting.

/en      /en.html   301!
/en/     /en.html   301
/en/*    /en.html   301

# Anything else from the old Wix site -> home page (keep this line last)
/*       /          301
